          "tz": 330
        },
        "subject": "LU-20276 tests: Wait for ZFS frees after sanityn/56a,56b",
        "message": "LU-20276 tests: Wait for ZFS frees after sanityn/56a,56b\n\ntest_56b causes OOM in test_70/71 using ZFS 2.4.N\nTo avoid OOM, this patch reorders stack_trap\nin such a way that the file is 'rm' first and\nthen waited for all TXG to be committed. Also,\nthis patch adds function 'zfs_wait_free_osts'\nto reclaim free space in function 56a and 56b\nbefore they end and after delete of file. (This\nis a workaround for now, please see JIRA for\ndetails)\n\nAlso, lower the freeing speed to 5 from 30.\n\nThis patch also enables test_56b. As, after the\nabove changes OOM is not seen.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.7\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el9.8\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanityn fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.2\nFixes: 3d34b39cb470 (\"LU-8137 utils: fix llverdev for use on regular files\")\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: Ib4a3de285b4826b26efed41fdcbb90fcd0e307d6\n"
      },
